<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ATHLETICS-RACE WALKING TO HAVE OWN GRAND PRIX SERIES.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-RACE WALKING TO HAVE OWN GRAND PRIX SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>PODEBRADI, Czech Republic 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Race walking will have its own grand prix series next year, Primo Nebiolo, president of the International Amateur Athletic Federation, said on Friday.</p>
<p>Nebiolo said details of venues and prize money would be released later this year.</p>
</text>
